KasiLedger app

This package is an installable, offline-friendly web app.

How to install it on an Android phone:
1. Put these files on a secure website (HTTPS). A normal website link is enough.
2. Open that link in Chrome on the phone.
3. Tap Chrome's three-dot menu.
4. Tap "Install app" or "Add to Home screen".
5. Open KasiLedger from the new icon on the home screen.

After its first successful load, KasiLedger can open offline. Your shop records stay on that device. Use Settings to make a readable export and a password-protected backup before changing phones or clearing browser data.

Important: This package is not an Android Play Store APK. It is a privacy-first installable web app, so it does not need a bank connection, account, or cloud server.
